GC_LobbyGameMode : "{A79C4E0A43DEB821}Prefabs/MP/Modes/GC_LobbyGameMode.et" {
 ID "48BCE1FF59D282AD"
 components {
  GC_LobbyManager "{6A137A39106A4973}" {
   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{A92AD9353AC9B802}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "Summary"
     m_sContent "Canadian forces have been pursuing an FIA cell for the past several days. After successfully isolating the cell and cutting off its escape routes, the Canadians have finally fixed them in position."\
     ""\
     "Can the Canadians finish the job and destroy the FIA cell before they find a way to break out?"\
     ""\
     "<h2>NOTES</h2>"\
     "<b>• FIA player only permitted CAF if 20+</b>"
     m_eAudience 1
    }
    GC_Briefing "{17AF163BC6E39A6A}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "<h2>PRELIMS</h2>"\
     "DTL: 28/05/2025, 1335hrs, Joutkallio, Ruha."\
     "Weather: Cloudy, with no forecast of change."\
     ""\
     "<h2>LORE</h2>"\
     "Canadian forces have been operating in Ruha as part of an ongoing security operation against the FIA, whose continued activity throughout the region has threatened local stability and freedom of movement."\
     ""\
     "Several days ago, Canadian forces engaged a large FIA formation during a major clash in the region. The engagement resulted in the destruction of the majority of the FIA company, but several elements managed to break contact and escape into the surrounding countryside."\
     ""\
     "One of these elements, a small FIA cell, has remained on the move ever since. Canadian forces have been tracking their movements and applying pressure for several days, gradually cutting off their escape routes and forcing them further into the countryside."\
     ""\
     "The pursuit has now reached Joutkallio. With their routes out of the area cut off and Canadian forces having finally caught up, the remaining FIA cell has been isolated and fixed in position."\
     ""\
     "The Canadians now have an opportunity to finish what they started and destroy the remaining FIA force."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{78B1425DE68ED248}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "<h2>PRELIMS</h2>"\
     "DTL: 15/08/1990, 1200hr, Al-Hadra, Kuwait."\
     "Weather: Clear, visability 1km+, no forecast of change."\
     ""\
     "<h2>LORE</h2>  "\
     "Following the coalition invasion of Kuwait, Iraqi forces have begun a fighting withdrawal while attempting to delay the coalition advance and retain control of key urban areas. Although the front line continues to move rapidly, isolated pockets of resistance remain determined to hold strategically important positions."\
     ""\
     "Al-Hadra has become one such battleground. British forces have established a fortified compound within the city to coordinate operations and maintain control of the surrounding area. Its location allows coalition forces to observe enemy movement, secure key routes, and project influence across the city."\
     ""\
     "Known locally as CIMIC House, the compound has become a significant obstacle to Iraqi operations. As long as it remains in British hands, Iraqi forces are unable to move freely through Al-Hadra or fully secure the area."\
     ""\
     "With coalition forces continuing their advance elsewhere, Iraqi commanders have committed a large force to seize the compound before it can be reinforced. The garrison now faces a determined assault and must hold its position until the attack is broken."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "FIA"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{929A83EF457C270A}" {
     m_iOrder 3
     m_sTitle "Enemy forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
     "Enemy forces consist of a platoon+ of FIA personnel, concentrated around the hamlet of Joutkallio and the surrounding terrain. Their known limits of advance appear to be the main supply route to the west and the dirt track to the south."\
     ""\
     "The terrain around Joutkallio contains numerous large boulders providing ample hard cover, even across otherwise open ground. Vegetation is sparser than in surrounding areas, providing generally better observation, although numerous long-running depressions in the terrain allow for concealed movement and rapid repositioning."\
     ""\
     "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
     "• No armoured vehicle capabilities."\
     "• They possess organic offensive and reconnaissance drone capabilities."\
     ""\
     "<h2>SERVICE & SUPPORT</h2>"\
     "• No reinforcements. This cell has been cut off, fixed, and isolated. Expect the FIA to make a final stand."\
     "• Very limited remaining supplies. The cell has been operating mostly on foot for several days, following repeated skirmishes."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{E050BFA4FBA3061E}" {
     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "Enemy forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
     "Enemy forces consist of <b>C Company, 3rd Battalion, Princess Patricia's Canadian Light Infantry (3 PPCLI)</b>, with approximately 32 personnel. They are currently staging at a barnyard southwest of Joutkallio and preparing to conduct an assault on our position as seen by our drone."\
     ""\
     "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
     "• Canadian forces have 2x JLTVs equipped with .50cal HMGs, providing significant mobile direct-fire support and several unarmed which we doubt will be used due to how close they are already."\
     "• The enemy has a significant intelligence advantage, they know pretty much everything about us from strength, capabilities, and supplies."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "FIA"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{5B0ECAE684F6586D}" {
     m_iOrder 5
     m_sTitle "Friendly forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
     "We are <b>1st platoon, C Company, 3rd Battalion, Princess Patricia's Canadian Light Infantry (3 PPCLI)</b>, consisting of 32 personnel. Currently staging at a barnyard southwest of the FIA's position, preparing to conduct our assault on Joutkallio."\
     ""\
     "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
     "• We have 2x JLTVs equipped with .50cal HMGs available to provide mobile direct-fire support."\
     "- Note: Theres 4x unarmed JLTVs at the staging area but these <i>will</i> remain behind, as the short distance to the objective makes them unnecessary for the assault. "\
     ""\
     "<h2>SERVICE & SUPPORT</h2>"\
     "• 2nd platoon and 3rd platoon have set up their blocking positions south-east and north-west of us."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{9454AE57710ED24C}" {
     m_iOrder 6
     m_sTitle "Friendly forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
     "We are the remaining elements of an FIA company, consisting of a platoon+ of personnel. After several days of pursuit and repeated skirmishes with Canadian forces, we have been forced into the hamlet of Joutkallio and the surrounding terrain."\
     ""\
     "Our forces are concentrated around Joutkallio, with the main supply route to the west and dirt track to the south marking our current limits of movement."\
     ""\
     "If my drone is destroyed, my standing orders are to remain at the built-up area and defend it."\
     ""\
     "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
     "• We have no armoured vehicle capabilities."\
     "• We possess organic offensive and reconnaissance drone capabilities. (1x MAVIC with 14x VOG25 impact grenades)"\
     "• The terrain around Joutkallio contains numerous large boulders providing hard cover across otherwise open ground."\
     "Sparse vegetation provides generally good observation, while numerous terrain depressions allow for concealed movement and rapid repositioning."\
     ""\
     "<h2>SERVICE & SUPPORT</h2>"\
     "• No reinforcements. We have been cut off and isolated."\
     "• Supplies are very limited after several days of movement and repeated skirmishes."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "FIA"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{C27576481DDAAB90}" {
     m_iOrder 7
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "<h2>MISSION STATEMENT</h2>"\
     "Conduct a <b>DELIBERATE ASSAULT</b> to <b>DESTROY</b> the FIA cell by <b>SWEEPING</b> the area and <b>SECURING</b>the hamlet of Joutkallio."\
     ""\
     "<h2>MISSION DESCRIPTION</h2>"\
     "The remaining FIA cell has been isolated within Joutkallio following several days of pursuit and repeated skirmishes after our major battle last week. Their escape routes have been cut off, their supplies are running low, and no reinforcements are coming. They are now fixed in position and preparing to make a final stand."\
     ""\
     "We are to assault Joutkallio, <b>CLEAR</b> the surrounding terrain and built-up area in order to <b>DESTROY</b> the cell and <b>SECURE</b> the area once again."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{23888E2237BFAF9A}" {
     m_iOrder 8
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "<h2>MISSION STATEMENT</h2>"\
     "Conduct a <b>DELIBERATE DEFENCE</b> to repel the advancing Canadian forces and prevent them from destroying our remaining cell."\
     ""\
     "<h2>MISSION DESCRIPTION</h2>"\
     "Canadian forces have pursued us for several days following the destruction of our company. Our escape routes have now been cut off and the enemy has finally caught up, leaving our remaining cell isolated within Joutkallio."\
     ""\
     "We are to establish a determined defence throughout the hamlet and surrounding terrain. Inflict as many casualties as possible. Preserve our remaining personnel and equipment where possible, but do not allow the Canadians to overrun our position without a fight. If we live through this attack we might be able to conduct a breakout."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "FIA"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{9FE628677E2049AD}" {
     m_iOrder 9
     m_sTitle "Comsig"
     m_sContent "<h2>CALLSIGNS</h2>"\
     "• HQ - 31HQ"\
     "• 1SEC - 31Alpha"\
     "• 2SEC - 31Bravo"\
     "• WEP - 31Charlie"\
     ""\
     "<h2>FREQ/CHAN</h2>"\
     "• Platoon net - 42hz"\
     ""\
     "<h2>PASSWORDS</h2>"\
     "All can be changed at CO's discretion."\
     "• <b>Challenge:</b> Donkey | <b>Password:</b> Squadron"\
     "• Running password: 57"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{E48877A21FC840A6}" {
     m_iOrder 10
     m_sTitle "Mission notes"
     m_sContent "<h2>END CONDITIONS</h2>"\
     "<b>CAF victory:</b>"\
     "Sweep and clear 90% of FIA forces between the MSR west and the dirt track south of Joutkallio."\
     ""\
     "<b>FIA victory:</b>"\
     "Destroy 90% of CAF forces"\
     ""\
     "<h2>NOTESs</h2>"\
     "<b>• FIA player only permitted CAF if 20+</b>"\
     "• JIP TP: Manual"\
     ""\
     "Mission made by TheLocalPub. Please use the <b>#feedback</b> channel on Discord to report issues or submit suggestions."
    }
   }
  }
 }
}
